    is go through that portal, travel through different dimension and reach to Praxis's
    place. and defeat him
  - Each dimension will have powerful enemy. if you defeat them and they drop a orb,
    bring it back to me. that orb will unlock more powerful items call relics, will
    help you easy defeat enemies.
  - good luck, ADVENTURE. im always here to help you unlock relics if you bring me
    the orb.
  orbHaveDialogue:
  - Oh, you have it. this call relic orb. it will unlock more powerful relics to
    help you defeat enemies more easy.
  - let me see...
  orbNotHaveDialogue:
  - sorry, but you don't have any relic orb.
  - come back when you have it. i will unlock more relics when you bring it to me,
    adventure
  dialogueUI: {fileID: 849908345}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 463052799}
  pressFText: {fileID: 900691614}
  choicePanel: {fileID: 762356493}
  button1: {fileID: 1305425503}
  button2: {fileID: 482420701}
  typingSpeed: 0.05
